{"seq":2,"slug":"differentiable-rasterization","title":"可微光栅化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/gaussian-splatting/differentiable-rasterization","wordCount":1540,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"可微光栅化\">可微光栅化</h1><p>NeRF 慢，是因为它沿每条光线走几百步、每步查一次网络。高斯泼溅快，是因为它根本不沿光线走——它把几百万颗高斯像投影仪一样「拍」到屏幕上，让 GPU 的光栅化硬件一次性把它们刷成像素。这个从「逐光线积分」到「逐图元投影」的转向，是实时渲染的全部秘密。但天下没有免费的速度：投影后必须按深度严格排序、再做 alpha 混合，排序就成了这条路线最硬的工程。这一篇拆解这套可微光栅化管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可微光栅化把渲染拆成四步：投影、分块、排序、混合。投影是把 3D 高斯连同其协方差一起投到 2D 图像平面，得到一个 2D 高斯（椭圆足迹）；分块是把屏幕切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\times16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 的 tile，把每颗高斯分配给它覆盖的 tile；排序是在每个 tile 内按深度对高斯排序；混合是在每个像素上沿排好的顺序做 alpha 合成。整条管线对所有高斯参数可微，梯度能回传去更新 <a href=\"gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a> 的每组参数。</p>\n<p>关键认知：最后那步 alpha 混合，和 <a href=\"../nerf/volume-rendering\">体渲染</a> 的离散合成是同一个公式。像素颜色仍是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\sum_{i} \\mathbf{c}_i\\, \\alpha_i \\prod_{j&lt;i}(1 - \\alpha_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只不过这里的「采样点序列」不再来自沿光线采样，而是来自投影到该像素、按深度排好序的那串高斯。NeRF 沿光线走得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha_i, \\mathbf{c}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，高斯泼溅靠投影得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha_i, \\mathbf{c}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——alpha 合成这个「公共货币」两边通用，区别只在采样点哪来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[几百万 3D 高斯] --&gt; B[投影到 2D&lt;br/&gt;3D 协方差 -&gt; 2D 椭圆足迹]&#10;  B --&gt; C[分块: 屏幕切 16x16 tile&lt;br/&gt;高斯按覆盖分配到 tile]&#10;  C --&gt; D[GPU 基数排序&lt;br/&gt;每 tile 内按深度排]&#10;  D --&gt; E[每像素沿序 alpha 混合&lt;br/&gt;front-to-back]&#10;  E --&gt; F[渲染图像]&#10;  F --&gt; G[与真值比对求损失]&#10;  G --&gt; H[梯度回传&lt;br/&gt;更新位置/协方差/alpha/球谐]&#10;  H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[几百万 3D 高斯] --&gt; B[投影到 2D&lt;br/&gt;3D 协方差 -&gt; 2D 椭圆足迹]\n  B --&gt; C[分块: 屏幕切 16x16 tile&lt;br/&gt;高斯按覆盖分配到 tile]\n  C --&gt; D[GPU 基数排序&lt;br/&gt;每 tile 内按深度排]\n  D --&gt; E[每像素沿序 alpha 混合&lt;br/&gt;front-to-back]\n  E --&gt; F[渲染图像]\n  F --&gt; G[与真值比对求损失]\n  G --&gt; H[梯度回传&lt;br/&gt;更新位置/协方差/alpha/球谐]\n  H --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"投影-3d-协方差到-2d-足迹\">投影：3D 协方差到 2D 足迹</h2><p>把一颗 3D 高斯投到图像上，不能只投它的中心，还要投它的「形状」——协方差也要变换。透视投影是非线性的，会把高斯变成非高斯，所以 3DGS 用一阶泰勒展开做局部线性近似：用投影变换的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 和视图变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，把 3D 协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 近似成 2D 协方差</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>J</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma&#x27; = J\\,W\\,\\Sigma\\,W^\\top J^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这给出图像平面上的一个 2D 高斯椭圆，即这颗高斯在屏幕上的「足迹」。足迹决定它影响哪些像素、以及在每个像素处的权重（中心强、边缘弱）。这种「把带形状的图元溅射到屏幕」的做法，正是「splatting（泼溅）」一名的由来——它是图形学里 EWA splatting 的可微化复兴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分块与排序-实时的真正瓶颈\">分块与排序：实时的真正瓶颈</h2><p><a href=\"../nerf/volume-rendering\">体渲染</a> 里强调过 alpha 合成必须 front-to-back 有序，NeRF 沿光线天然有序所以免费。高斯泼溅没这个福利：投到同一像素的几百万高斯散落在各个深度，必须显式排序。逐像素排序代价爆炸，3DGS 的工程巧思是<strong>分块 + tile 级排序</strong>——把屏幕切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\times16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 的 tile，每颗高斯按 2D 足迹分配到它覆盖的所有 tile，然后对「(tile id, 深度)」做一次全局 GPU 基数排序。同一 tile 内的所有像素共享这一份排好的高斯列表，把排序成本从「每像素一次」摊薄成「每 tile 一次」。</p>\n<p>这步是性能命门。下表对比两条路线在「获得有序采样点」上的差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>NeRF（体渲染）</th>\n<th>高斯泼溅（光栅化）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样点来源</td>\n<td>沿光线主动采样</td>\n<td>高斯投影到像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度顺序</td>\n<td>沿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天然有序</td>\n<td>需显式排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序粒度</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>tile 级（16x16）基数排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成公式</td>\n<td>alpha 合成</td>\n<td>同一 alpha 合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要开销</td>\n<td>网络查询</td>\n<td>排序 + 混合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的研究热点很多就集中在这一步：有工作改用无排序的随机光栅化（StochasticSplats）规避排序开销，也有把可微光栅化直接映射到图形硬件管线、用 GPU 原生 rasterizer 加速的方案（如 2025 年关于高效可微硬件光栅化的工作），还有 FlashGS 这类面向大规模高分辨率的高效实现。它们都在攻同一个点：让「排序+混合」更快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向传播-梯度怎么穿过排序\">反向传播：梯度怎么穿过排序</h2><p>可微的难点在于：排序本身是不可微的离散操作，梯度怎么过去？答案是排序只决定「合成顺序」这个离散结构，一旦顺序定下，alpha 合成公式对每颗高斯的颜色、不透明度、2D 位置与协方差都是连续可导的。前向时记录每像素的高斯贡献序列，反向时沿这个序列把梯度逐项传回——顺序当作常量、参数当作变量。于是位置梯度会推高斯往该去的地方挪、协方差梯度会调它的胖瘦朝向、alpha 梯度会调它的实虚。这些梯度驱动的不只是参数微调，还触发离散的增删，详见 <a href=\"gaussian-optimization\">优化与剪枝</a>。整条链路印证了 <a href=\"../foundations/why-neural-rendering\">为何神经渲染</a> 的第一性原理：可见性的离散部分被固定，连续部分全程可导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可微光栅化把渲染拆成投影、分块、排序、混合四步，用「逐图元投影」代替 NeRF 的「逐光线积分」，这是实时的来源。</li>\n<li>投影时协方差也要变换：用雅可比做局部线性近似，把 3D 高斯投成 2D 椭圆足迹（splatting 由此得名）。</li>\n<li>最后的 alpha 混合与体渲染是同一公式，区别只在采样点来自投影而非沿光线采样。</li>\n<li>排序是性能命门：3DGS 用「分块 + tile 级 GPU 基数排序」把排序成本从每像素摊薄到每 tile，2026 年研究多在优化这一步。</li>\n<li>排序是离散不可微的，但它只定合成顺序；顺序固定后 alpha 合成对所有连续参数可导，梯度据此回传并触发后续的增删。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>被投影和混合的图元本身：<a href=\"gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a></li>\n<li>梯度如何触发离散增删：<a href=\"gaussian-optimization\">优化与剪枝</a></li>\n<li>同一 alpha 合成的连续积分版本：<a href=\"../nerf/volume-rendering\">体渲染</a></li>\n<li>跨库：光栅化与 GPU 并行排序的图形学背景，见 <a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/digital-image-representation\">数字图像表示</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可微光栅化","id":"可微光栅化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"投影：3D 协方差到 2D 足迹","id":"投影-3d-协方差到-2d-足迹"},{"level":2,"text":"分块与排序：实时的真正瓶颈","id":"分块与排序-实时的真正瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"反向传播：梯度怎么穿过排序","id":"反向传播-梯度怎么穿过排序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"3D 高斯表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/gaussian-splatting/gaussian-representation"},"next":{"title":"优化与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/gaussian-splatting/gaussian-optimization"}}